         . 1.INTRODUCTION

EduGenie is an AI-powered learning assistant developed to support students in their academic learning and preparation. The main purpose of the system is to provide an intelligent platform where students can interact with learning content and receive useful AI-based assistance.

Traditional learning methods often require students to spend considerable time reading large amounts of study material and preparing notes and questions manually. EduGenie aims to simplify this process by using artificial intelligence to assist students in understanding and preparing educational content.

The application is developed using Python-based technologies and AI concepts. It provides an interactive learning environment where users can access educational assistance through the application.

The project demonstrates practical implementation of Python programming, backend development, AI integration, user interaction, and educational technology concepts. EduGenie can be further enhanced by adding more AI capabilities, personalized learning, student progress tracking, database integration, and additional educational tools.


