The system focuses on improving the learning experience by allowing students to interact with an AI-based assistant and receive learning support. The project also provides practical exposure to backend development, application architecture, AI integration, API communication, testing, and security concepts.

The modular nature of the application provides scope for further development. Features such as database integration, authentication, student dashboards, learning analytics, personalized study plans, and additional AI-powered educational tools can be implemented in future versions.

Overall, EduGenie demonstrates the practical application of Python, backend development, Artificial Intelligence, and educational technology to build an intelligent learning assistant.


